# Development environments
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings. A session creates its worktree in the
# current directory, so sometimes inside this one, and each is a full copy of the repository.
# Until this folder became a repository of its own the rule lived in the monorepo's .gitignore,
# a file this repository does not carry.
.claude/

# Windows shortcuts dropped in the mod folder, never content.
*.lnk

# Folder-view metadata Explorer drops when a custom folder icon is set (Mod/About/ModIcon.png
# here), never content, and specific to one machine's view settings.
desktop.ini

# Compressed runtime texture cache (BC7_UNORM), regenerated from the shipped PNGs and not
# authored content. Never redistribute a binary the source PNG already covers.
*.dds

# Pickle evidence and build output: kept on disk, never in git (PickleTools can produce gigabytes in a day).
# A one-line text summary per run goes in docs/runs/ instead.
Tests/Pickle/Evidence/
Tests/Pickle/runs/
.build/
